---
title: Fantasy Football PI - Data flow and layer boundaries
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph sources["1. Inputs"]
        ESPN["ESPN player, schedule and live-stat feeds"]
        VALUES["ESPN, Yahoo, DraftSharks and FantasyNerds values"]
        MFL["MFL historical CSV, JSON and HTML exports"]
        ACTIONS["Owner and commissioner actions<br/>Draft, lineup, waiver, trade and rule edits"]
    end

    subgraph ingestion["2. Ingestion and transformation - source-specific pipelines"]
        LIVE["Player import and live-scoring ingestion<br/>Normalize payloads; resolve ESPN IDs"]
        ETL["Projection ETL<br/>Normalize and validate; resolve players; aggregate values"]
        HISTORY["Historical archive, normalize and import<br/>Map provider leagues, seasons, franchises and players"]
        AUDIT["Pipeline evidence<br/>Raw files, checksums, fingerprints and run status"]
    end

    subgraph storage["3. PostgreSQL - persisted facts, configuration and derived records"]
        IDENT[("Identity and season context<br/>players, player_seasons, aliases, ID mappings<br/>leagues, users, league_mfl_seasons")]
        STATS[("Observations and events<br/>player_weekly_stats, nfl_games<br/>MFL normalized facts and ingestion records")]
        DOMAIN[("League operations and configuration<br/>draft_picks, lineup_submissions, matchups<br/>rules, keepers, waivers, trades, ledger")]
        DERIVED[("Values and analytical records<br/>platform_projections, draft_values<br/>manager_efficiency and playoff snapshots")]
    end

    subgraph schema["Schema control - not a row-processing layer"]
        BASE["SQLAlchemy Base<br/>Shared declarative model registry"]
        META["Base.metadata<br/>Table, column and relationship definitions"]
        MIG["Canonical Alembic migrations<br/>Empty DB bootstrap / explicit legacy adoption"]
        ARCHIVE[("Legacy archive<br/>Recovery evidence; not a normal page data source")]
    end

    subgraph backend["4. Backend access and business logic"]
        ORM["SQLAlchemy models + Session<br/>SessionLocal / get_db; queries and transactions"]
        SERVICES["Domain services and analytical calculations<br/>Identity, scoring, standings, history, draft and ledger"]
        LEGACY["Existing router-local queries and calculations<br/>As-built bypass; not the intended layer boundary"]
        ROUTERS["FastAPI routers + authentication / authorization"]
        DTOS["Response contracts<br/>Pydantic where declared; JSON payloads elsewhere"]
        WRITE["Request validation and authorization<br/>Domain mutations via services or existing router logic"]
    end

    subgraph frontend["5. Browser"]
        CLIENT["Shared API client<br/>Feature API helpers where adopted"]
        STATE["Server results<br/>TanStack Query where adopted; local state elsewhere"]
        PAGES["React page families<br/>Detailed database-to-page mapping in data-page-consumers.mmd"]
    end

    subgraph planned["Planned shared semantic adoption - not yet a universal runtime layer"]
        SEMANTICS["Identity + league / season / week + ownership context<br/>Point basis and effective scoring definition<br/>Provenance, freshness, unknown versus measured zero"]
    end

    ESPN --> LIVE
    VALUES --> ETL
    MFL --> HISTORY
    LIVE --> IDENT
    LIVE --> STATS
    LIVE -->|reconcile affected matchups and metrics| DOMAIN
    ETL --> IDENT
    ETL --> DERIVED
    HISTORY --> IDENT
    HISTORY --> STATS
    HISTORY --> DOMAIN
    LIVE --> AUDIT
    HISTORY --> AUDIT
    AUDIT -->|persisted run evidence where supported| STATS

    BASE -.->|models inherit from Base| ORM
    BASE -.->|registers definitions| META
    META -.->|definition reference, not row flow| MIG
    MIG -.->|creates or changes schema| IDENT
    MIG -.->|creates or changes schema| STATS
    MIG -.->|creates or changes schema| DOMAIN
    MIG -.->|creates or changes schema| DERIVED
    MIG -.->|explicit adoption preserves original rows| ARCHIVE

    IDENT --> ORM
    STATS --> ORM
    DOMAIN --> ORM
    DERIVED --> ORM
    ORM --> SERVICES
    ORM --> LEGACY
    SERVICES --> ROUTERS
    LEGACY --> ROUTERS
    ROUTERS --> DTOS
    DTOS -->|HTTP JSON responses| CLIENT
    CLIENT --> STATE
    STATE --> PAGES

    ACTIONS -->|authenticated API requests| WRITE
    PAGES -->|mutations through API client| WRITE
    WRITE -->|transactional model updates| ORM
    ORM -->|commit domain changes| DOMAIN
    SERVICES -->|persist derived results where applicable| DERIVED

    SEMANTICS -.->|planned consumer contract adoption| SERVICES
    SEMANTICS -.->|planned context and provenance in responses| DTOS

    classDef control fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#111827;
    classDef planned fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#111827,stroke-dasharray:5 5;
    classDef caution fill:#fefce8,stroke:#a16207,color:#111827;
    class BASE,META,MIG,ARCHIVE control;
    class SEMANTICS planned;
    class LEGACY caution;
